        {"zh": "我这么小，没人注意", "en": "I am so small, no one notices."},
        {"zh": "花林里真暖", "en": "The flower forest is warm."},
        {"zh": "我在花瓣上暖翅膀", "en": "I warm my wings on a petal."},
        {"zh": "我抖了抖薄翅", "en": "I flutter my thin wings."},
        {"zh": "我不敢飞太远", "en": "I dare not fly far."},
